{
  "key": 9234,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0450_T01R0202_PalletTown_House1_Text_GymOnTheHill",
      "en_US": [
        "Prof. Oak has had folks hauling\n",
        "things up that rocky hill all month.\r",
        "They say it’s a Pokémon Gym!\n",
        "In quiet little Pallet Town!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0450_T01R0202_EventMons_Text_CapBoyIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you know a Trainer from\n",
        "PALLET Town once went to every\r",
        "region in the world?\r",
        "I collected a cap from each one,\n",
        "just like his! Then I took them\r",
        "on a trip around Kanto…\r",
        "…and lost every single one.\n",
        "Seven caps! Waaah!\r",
        "Hey, you travel a lot, right? If\n",
        "you find my caps, I’ll trade you\r",
        "something really special for\n",
        "each one!\r",
        "Here, put them in this!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0450_T01R0202_EventMons_Text_CapBoyCase",
      "en_US": [
        "My Cap Case! Look carefully.\n",
        "Caps get snagged in the\r",
        "strangest places."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0450_T01R0202_PalletTown_House1_Text_Pidgey",
      "en_US": "Pidgey: Pijji!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0450_T01R0202_PalletTown_House1_Text_Sign",
      "en_US": [
        "Family photo of the Ashfords.\n",
        "Everyone is squinting at the sun."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0450_T01R0202_EventMons_Text_CapBoyThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "My {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! You found it!\r",
        "Here, this Pikachu wears one\n",
        "just like it. A trade’s a trade!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0450_T01R0202_EventMons_Text_CapBoyHint",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} caps are still out\n",
        "there.\r",
        "I think I lost the {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\n",
        "somewhere around {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0450_T01R0202_EventMons_Text_CapBoyAll",
      "en_US": [
        "All seven caps! My collection’s\n",
        "back!\r",
        "You’re a real partner. This\n",
        "PIKACHU wears the Partner Cap.\r",
        "It’s the most special of all!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0450_T01R0202_EventMons_Text_CapBoyDone",
      "en_US": [
        "My caps are all back, thanks to\n",
        "you! Take good care of those\r",
        "PIKACHU!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0450_T01R0202_EventMons_Text_Received",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0450_T01R0202_EventMons_Text_NoRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh… There’s no room for it in\n",
        "your party or your boxes. Make\r",
        "some space and come back!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0450_T01R0202_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
